If it is not present add the following:

```JSON
    "dictionaryDefinitions": [
        {
            "name": "your-dictionary-name",
            "path": "relative-path-to-shared-dictionary-txt-file"
        }
    ]
'''

> your-dictionary-name: A name you choose for this dictionary definition.
> relative-path-to-shared-dictionary-txt-file: the relative path from the .cspelljson file to the location of the dictionary text file you created in 2.

> In the example used in these instructions images that would be:

```JSON
    "dictionaryDefinitions": [
        {
            "name": "ui-dictionary",
            "path": "../../UiSharedDictionary.txt"
        }
    ]
```


